WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.528
Demonstrate respect for important Ghanaian national symbols.

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:09.089
National symbols help represent Ghana’s identity and history. The curriculum names

00:00:09.089 --> 00:00:14.241
the national flag, Coat of Arms, National Anthem, National Pledge and Adinkra

00:00:14.241 --> 00:00:14.671
symbols.

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:20.458
We show respect by handling flags carefully and behaving respectfully during national

00:00:20.458 --> 00:00:24.152
ceremonies. Learn the meanings of symbols without damaging them.

00:00:25.033 --> 00:00:29.940
Create a display of two national symbols and explain a respectful way to treat each.
